  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSATitle:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ବର୍ତ୍ତମାନ ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପ୍ରଶ୍ନ ଯୋଡନ୍ତୁ
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSALeadHtml:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସତର୍କତାମୂଳକ ଭାବରେ ଯଦି ଆପଣ ଆପଣଙ୍କର ପାସୱାର୍ଡ ଭୁଲି ଯାଆନ୍ତି, ତାହାହେଲେ 3 ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପ୍ରଶ୍ନର ଚୟନ କରନ୍ତୁ. ଆପଣଙ୍କର ଉତ୍ତର ଅବିସ୍ମରଣୀୟ ରହେ, ତାହା ନିଶ୍ଚିତ କରନ୍ତୁ.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSAErrorVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: You’ll need to finish entering your security questions before you can continue.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Third one's a charm. Choose your last question, type the answer, and you're good to go.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Now for the second one. Same drill.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SQSA1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Now you can set up 3 security questions to help you reset your password if you forget it. Choose the first question and type your answer.
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder3:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପ୍ରଶ୍ନ (3 ର 3)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder2:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପ୍ରଶ୍ନ (3 ର 2)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestionPlaceholder1:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସୁରକ୍ଷା ପ୍ରଶ୍ନ (3 ର 1)
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion6:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ଆପଣ ପଢୁଥିବା ପ୍ରଥମ ବିଦ୍ୟାଳୟର ନାମ କ'ଣ?
  \oobeLocalAccount\SecurityQuestion5:
