  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସଂକ୍ଷେପରେ, ମୁଁ ଆପଣଙ୍କର ବ୍ୟକ୍ତିଗତ ସହାୟକ ଏବଂ ସାଇଡକିକ୍‍ ଅଟେ.<br/>ଯେତେବେଳେ ଆପଣ ପ୍ରସ୍ତୁତ ଥାନ୍ତି.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ହାଏ, ମୁଁ Cortana.<br/>କାର୍ଯ୍ୟଗୁଡିକ ଅଧିକ ସହଜ କରିବା ପାଇଁ ଏବଂ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ ସମାପ୍ତ କରିବାରେ ଆପଣଙ୍କୁ ସହାୟତା କରିବା ପାଇଁ ମୁଁ ଏଠାରେ ରହିଛି.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: Cortana ହେଉଛି ଆପଣଙ୍କର ସାଇଡ୍‌କିକ୍, ଯେକୌଣସି ବିଷୟ ଯାହା ଆପଣଙ୍କୁ ସୁପର୍, ହିରୋଇକ୍, କିମ୍ବା କେବଳ ଅନ୍ ଟାଇମ୍ ରଖିଥାଏ ସେଥି ସହିତ ସହାୟତା କରିବା ପାଇଁ ପ୍ରସ୍ତୁତ.<br/><br/>Cortana କୁ ତାହାର ସର୍ବଶ୍ରେଷ୍ଠ କାର୍ଯ୍ୟ କରିବାକୁ ଦେବା ପାଇଁ, Microsoft ଆପଣଙ୍କର ଡିଭାଇସ୍‌ରେ ଆପଣଙ୍କର ଅବସ୍ଥାନ ଏବଂ ଅବସ୍ଥାନ ଇତିବୃତି, ସମ୍ପର୍କ, ଭଏସ୍ ଇନ୍‌ପୁଟ୍, ସନ୍ଧାନ ଇତିବୃତି, କ୍ୟାଲେଣ୍ଡର୍ ବିବରଣୀ, ବାର୍ତ୍ତା ଏବଂ ଆପ୍ଲିକେସନ୍‌ସମୂହ ଠାରୁ ବିଷୟବସ୍ତୁ ଏବଂ ଯୋଗାଯୋଗ ଇତିବୃତି, ଏବଂ ଅନ୍ୟ ସୂଚନା ସହିତ ସୂଚନା ସଂଗ୍ରହ ଏବଂ ବ୍ୟବହାର କରିଥାଏ. Microsoft Edge ରେ, Cortana ଆପଣଙ୍କର ବ୍ରାଉଜିଂ ଇତିବୃତି ବ୍ୟବହାର କରିଥାଏ. ଆପଣ ସର୍ବଦା ନୋଟ୍‌ବୁକ୍‌ରେ Cortana କଣ ମନେରଖେ ବଦଳାଇପାରିବେ, Microsoft Edge ରେ Cortana କୁ ଅକ୍ଷମ କରିପାରିବେ, କିମ୍ବା Cortana କୁ ସମ୍ପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ରୂପେ ଟର୍ନ୍ ଅଫ୍ କରିପାରିବେ.
